.TH OMACHAT 1 "2026-10-01" "OmaChat"
.SH NAME
omachat \- terminal hosted messaging client
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B omachat
[--socket PATH]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Connects to the local daemon. Tab selects conversations. Enter sends and /help lists controls.
Use /dm HANDLE, /conversations, /history, /send CONVERSATION TEXT and /detach.
The server operator can read messages. /panic ERASE requires repeated confirmation and erases local state only.
